<title>UK: Hamburgische LB sets $100 mln exchangeable bond.</title>
<headline>Hamburgische LB sets $100 mln exchangeable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following exchangeable issue was announced by lead manager Salomon.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HAMBURGISCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON **3.125-3.375 MATURITY	.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE   EXCHANGEABLE  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    *</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	IND PREM   18-22</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.0	 SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED. *PAYMENT DATE 28 DAYS AFTER PRICING</p>
<p>		EXCHANGEABLE INTO COMMON SHARES OF VEBA AG</p>
<p>		CALLABLE FROM YEAR THREE AT PAR</p>
<p>-- LONDON NEWSROOM +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
